<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@/~part_III__cl_19> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@/~part_III__cl_19__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@> .
