<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@> .
