<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Pihak berkuasa yang meluluskan yang disebut terdahulu hendaklah—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_2__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@> .
