<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@/~part_II__cl_9> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "9" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@/~part_II__cl_9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@/~part_II__cl_9> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Suatu bangunan yang asalnya dibina bagi maksud selain daripada perumahan pekerja-pekerja tidak boleh digunakan untuk, atau ditukarkan bagi maksud, perumahan pekerja-pekerja, melainkan jika suatu permohonan bagi maksud itu telah dibuat kepada dan diluluskan oleh Ketua Pengarah."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@/~part_II__cl_9> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@> .
