<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Akta ini hendaklah terpakai di seluruh Malaysia."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@> .
