<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@/~part_V__cl_27__subsec_2__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@/~part_V__cl_27__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/35/msa@> .
